{"name": "Enginefall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"226\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"790\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/91f8485826dbd47d4ef97bde10e5ce6b.mp4?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enginefall is a new type of crafting multiplayer shooter. Board a colossal megatrain with your crew at the back, scavenge and build compact makeshift bases, push forward for better gear, then retreat to your Dagger shuttle to grow stronger and climb the train classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"476\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5d339c661bf95ea75490eed0a3fd3534.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/5d339c661bf95ea75490eed0a3fd3534.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enginefall takes place entirely on colossal moving trains. From cramped tail slums to lavish first-class cars and guarded engine rooms, every carriage is a living space to loot, fight over, turn into a base, or eventually claim as part of your own rolling home as you climb from tailie to conductor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"94\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/89873113299a708f29972fe8428355f0.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/89873113299a708f29972fe8428355f0.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/54f567390fd13e1dd61a77ffe2158fec.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/54f567390fd13e1dd61a77ffe2158fec.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enginefall is built around human opponents and allies. Raid trains with friends, defend your makeshift bases, and clash with other players over key routes and resources, with every encounter having the potential to flip from cooperation to conflict in a heartbeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"94\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76fee0adf12d04c9d9e7b25c28a030e6.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/76fee0adf12d04c9d9e7b25c28a030e6.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/1f04b8a83889df9b842952ffe7de81b2.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/1f04b8a83889df9b842952ffe7de81b2.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge as you go and turn whatever you find into useful gear, armor, and structures. Throw together compact bases for respawns and storage, craft upgraded gear as you move up the train, and adjust your loadout on the fly instead of sticking to a single pre-set build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"94\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/b8466e0d038a208fcbcd96ddf4f026fb.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/b8466e0d038a208fcbcd96ddf4f026fb.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"378\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.poster.avif?t=1787573771\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/extras/15d10160c8d0381d91f8e88ab69150bc.webm?t=1787573771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your Dagger shuttle from a rust bucket to a sleek assault craft, and eventually take control of a fully player-owned Marauder train. Expand from a single carriage into a chain of workshops, bunk rooms, and gun decks, then keep it supplied by hitting Titan trains and defending your moving fortress from rival conductors with your crew beside you.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Enginefall is a player-driven crafting shooter set on colossal, post-apocalyptic megatrains. Start in the tail alone or with friends as you scavenge, craft, and build your way to First Class. Seize better gear car by car, and escape with high-value loot to upgrade your personal home on the rails.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437390/908cf21a5f3bec81694fcd8ac3c4e2c6f335e94e/header.jpg?t=1787573771", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["PvP", "Survival", "Sandbox", "Open World", "Crafting", "Realistic"], "developers": "Red Rover Interactive", "publishers": "Red Rover Interactive", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2437390", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "12 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/-4uiLoxe0j8", "first_seen": 1781215200.0, "review_rank": 434}